            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-25T01:08:34.123361+00:00",
            "notes": "With round 2 you have a lot of flexibility on how you want to tackle things. If you feel like you aren't exactly anchoring your team but you are playing well enough to do so,  [Undying Loyalty](item_d0278c35-8006-4c8d-8f02-4fd0217fd3e2) is most likely the way to go. It's a huge supportive boost for your whole team as long as you are staying healthy enough to get value from the item. \n\nThe overhealth bonus will block more ultimates and save more teammates when supports are busy, especially by round 3 where you can hopefully afford  [Booming Voice](item_d751b552-4c3f-49d6-966b-611096fd2259) to give a near global boost to your team.",
